    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling space adventure combining exploration, strategy and arcade action! As a mousey space cadet,  explore beautifully pixelated galaxies to build new civilizations and fight for your species' survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you mouse enough to defend the galaxy? Well strap in, Cadet! By your intrepid actions, you stand to become the architect of mousekind's next great leap into the cosmos. Explore the vastness and voids of space, discover ancient moontemples and strange relics, and build a new home for your species-- one pixel at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/76eb3cc790bc95280478b21e8b08ee6f.poster.avif?t=1753887578\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/76eb3cc790bc95280478b21e8b08ee6f.webm?t=1753887578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/76eb3cc790bc95280478b21e8b08ee6f.mp4?t=1753887578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won't be easy: hostile invaders and cat colonizers will try to stop you as you grow your new civilization. You'll need to befriend quirky alien species, create unique weapons and upgrade your defenses to ensure your survival. Every new structure, tool and ally is a step towards victory. Welcome to ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/0da6db27e5484921a918466f51378428.avif?t=1753887578\" width=571 height=74 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753887578\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0 Explore uncharted stars, build new outposts, and battle opposing factions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753887578\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0 Build and defend modular space stations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753887578\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0 Discover new technology and use it to advance your cause. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753887578\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0Mine asteroids or build drones to do it for you. Spend your resources wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753887578\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0 Explore the uncharted, but not empty, dangers of deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753887578\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0 Discover a vast array of tech upgrades to aid in exploration, base-building, and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753887578\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0 Brave conflict with the ancient and cream-thirsty Kittylian empire in classic arcade-style side scrolling shoot-em-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753887578\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0Upgrade your captain and crew with unique skills and specialized abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/220c4ff471f90b7d626fa37dc3c43d21.poster.avif?t=1753887578\" width=800 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/220c4ff471f90b7d626fa37dc3c43d21.webm?t=1753887578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/220c4ff471f90b7d626fa37dc3c43d21.mp4?t=1753887578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/dab1b111aee20a85839185080f3eac22.poster.avif?t=1753887578\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/dab1b111aee20a85839185080f3eac22.webm?t=1753887578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/dab1b111aee20a85839185080f3eac22.mp4?t=1753887578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic side-scrolling action meets a strategic base builder in this retro return to arcade delight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/09cdd66d53f85b2c8cbbf35b0a4e7e15.avif?t=1753887578\" width=616 height=433 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling space adventure combining exploration, strategy and arcade action! As a mousey space cadet,  explore beautifully pixelated galaxies to build new civilizations and fight for your species' survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you mouse enough to defend the galaxy? Well strap in, Cadet! By your intrepid actions, you stand to become the architect of mousekind's next great leap into the cosmos. Explore the vastness and voids of space, discover ancient moontemples and strange relics, and build a new home for your species-- one pixel at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/76eb3cc790bc95280478b21e8b08ee6f.poster.avif?t=1753887578\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/76eb3cc790bc95280478b21e8b08ee6f.webm?t=1753887578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/76eb3cc790bc95280478b21e8b08ee6f.mp4?t=1753887578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won't be easy: hostile invaders and cat colonizers will try to stop you as you grow your new civilization. You'll need to befriend quirky alien species, create unique weapons and upgrade your defenses to ensure your survival. Every new structure, tool and ally is a step towards victory. Welcome to ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/0da6db27e5484921a918466f51378428.avif?t=1753887578\" width=571 height=74 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753887578\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0 Explore uncharted stars, build new outposts, and battle opposing factions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753887578\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0 Build and defend modular space stations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753887578\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0 Discover new technology and use it to advance your cause. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753887578\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0Mine asteroids or build drones to do it for you. Spend your resources wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753887578\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0 Explore the uncharted, but not empty, dangers of deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845020/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753887578\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0 Discover a vast array of tech upgrades to aid in exploration, base-building, and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets